\description{
Estimates \eqn{\log Z = \log \int L(\theta) p(\theta) \, d\theta} from
posterior draws and their unnormalized log-posterior values, using the
Truncated Harmonic Mean Estimator (THAMES) of Metodiev et al. (2023).
